{
  "info": {
    "name": "Trackora API - Full",
    "description": "Complete Trackora REST API collection.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. The `base_url` variable defaults to http://localhost:8000. Change it if your server runs elsewhere.\n3. Start by calling **Auth > Login (Admin)** (or any of the role-specific logins). Its test script auto-saves `access_token` and `refresh_token` into collection variables. All subsequent requests use `{{access_token}}` in the Authorization header.\n4. To test as a different role (Manager/Contributor/Viewer), run the corresponding login request; the token is updated.\n\n## Seeded users (password in parentheses)\n- admin@trackora.com (Admin123!) - ADMIN\n- manager@trackora.com (Manager123!) - MANAGER\n- john@trackora.com (John123!) - CONTRIBUTOR\n- jane@trackora.com (Jane123!) - CONTRIBUTOR\n- viewer@trackora.com (Viewer123!) - VIEWER\n\n## Variables captured automatically\n- `access_token`, `refresh_token` - from Login\n- `user_id` - from Users - List (first result)\n- `task_id` - from Tasks - List (first result)\n- `role_id` - from Roles - List (first result)\n- `notification_id` - from Notifications - List (first result)\n- `comment_id` - from Comments - List (first result)\n- `attachment_id` - from Attachments - List (first result)\n\nYou can manually override any of these in the Variables tab.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string"}]
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000"},
    {"key": "access_token", "value": ""},
    {"key": "refresh_token", "value": ""},
    {"key": "user_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "task_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "role_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "notification_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "comment_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "attachment_id", "value": ""}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"New\",\n  \"last_name\": \"User\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass123!\",\n  \"password_confirm\": \"StrongPass123!\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.tokens.access);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.tokens.refresh);", "  console.log('Tokens saved.');", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@trackora.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refresh);", "  console.log('Logged in as', j.user && j.user.email);", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Manager)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"manager@trackora.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Manager123!\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refresh);", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Contributor - John)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@trackora.com\",\n  \"password\": \"John123!\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refresh);", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Viewer)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"viewer@trackora.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Viewer123!\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refresh);", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh", ""]}
          },
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) {", "  const j = pm.response.json();", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access);", "  if (j.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refresh);", "}"]}}]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout/", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout", ""]}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Users",
